	"FriendlyName": "Adastrea Ships: Modular Space Assets",
	"Description": "Procedurally generated modular space-asset kit for Adastrea (realistic cyberpunk): small/medium/large ship carcasses with scaled add-on parts (engine, cargo, weapon, sensor, reactor) plus X4/Starfield/SE-style mountable modules, Project-Hyperion-inspired habitat rings and hollowed-asteroid stations. Ships import as separate per-part meshes with full 2K PBR texture sets (BaseColor/Normal/Roughness/Metallic/AO/Emissive). Regenerable from Tools/generate_adastrea_assets.py.",
